    "Multi Car Insurance",
    "Add the whole family to one policy – even if you don’t live together. Plus, everyone can manage their policy anytime with MyAccount.",
    "No more worrying about multiple renewal dates – when you add a new car to your policy, the dates sync up.",
    "Every car that's claim-free and covered for 90 days or more gets a full year's no claims bonus. Plus, it won't affect yours if someone else claims.",
    "MultiCar insurance helps you save money on your car insurance by insuring multiple cars under one policy.",
    "Whether you want to insure your kids’ first cars or an extra ride for yourself, MultiCar can cover them all.",
    "It means you can save time, money and hassle by only having one policy to think about. One renewal date, one set of documents – plus a handy discount.",
    "MultiCar lets you cover multiple cars on one policy - even if they're at different addresses. You'll get the same cover as our standard car insurance, plus a discount for every car you add.",
    "Set up your policy with one car to get started.",
    "Add extra cars whenever they're ready to get a discount.",
    "You can add up to seven family members to get even more discounts.",
    "Here’s how much our MultiCar customers saved based on how many cars they insured with us:",
    "51% of customers saved with MultiCar compared to customers who bought the same cover as single policies. Data from November 2025 to April 2026. Doesn't include optional extras.",
