    "It means you have a safety net if you need to make a compensation claim or go to court.",
    "Whether it’s a broken bone or life-threatening injuries, we’re here for you if you have an accident.",
    "We’ll cover up to £100,000 to help deal with unexpected costs after an accident.",
    "If your car’s stolen or in an accident, we’ll keep you on the road with a hire car. You’ll get a similar-size car to yours, so it fits your lifestyle and needs.",
    "Or we can give you £400 to spend on travel costs or other expenses.",
    "Find out more about our range of optional add-ons.",
    "Not sure if MultiCar is for you? Find out below.",
    "A lot of people assume MultiCar is just for couples or families living under one roof – but that’s not the case! It can work across families in different homes, from siblings to grandparents and even in-laws, so you can all save money and manage your car insurance more easily.",
